WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.900
Narrator: In the shelter area, keep fans close to inner walls, away from glass - and if you're told, sit or crouch low and protect your head and neck.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:16.300
Narrator: Nobody goes back for belongings. If a second alert comes, stay where you are.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.100
Narrator: Help children, older fans and disabled fans.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Narrator: If something has fallen, don't touch it - report an Item of Interest, and keep people back on instruction.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.000
Narrator: No filming, no rumours, no posting. Shelter yourself too.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:39.700
Narrator: And at the all-clear, wait for instructions - leaving may be phased - then report to your supervisor so everyone is accounted for.
